# Merging a change here freezes the floor the next v1 schema edit is
# compared against (see schemas/README.md Compatibility). Require review
# from the spec owner before that floor moves.
/schemas/*.schema.json @vgmartinez
/schemas/testdata/baseline/ @vgmartinez

# registrycheck under internal/tools/ becomes the binary that judges
# later pull requests once it is on the default branch. Require review
# from the spec owner before that checker moves.
