# A pull request can edit the workflow and turn the rule-registry job
# into a no-op. Require review from the spec owner before that happens.
/.github/workflows/ @vgmartinez

# This file names the owners above. Require review before it changes.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @vgmartinez
